    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d358-a3">

                <pb facs="0474" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg386"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Schwedersky to Mr. Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-03-03"><hi rendition="#italic">March 3,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my letter of protest of the 2d
                    instant, I beg to add to same that I have omitted to state that, besides the
                    interests mentioned and owned by my firm, I am personally largely interested in
                    important mining concessions obtained from the Platien Government, for the
                    exploration of the mining concessions considerable money has been expended.</p>
                <p>Yours, respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Schwedersky.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
